{"about_the_game":"Become a <strong>Star Shaman</strong> and embark on an epic journey in this roguelike space shooter.<br><br>Hop from planet to planet in a stunningly beautiful and procedurally generated universe, where no playthrough is ever the same - except for the outstanding French-Touch infused soundtrack.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258580/extras/c5f3f9f34ee5fb34b5d83031b77e6488.poster.avif?t=1634652463\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258580/extras/c5f3f9f34ee5fb34b5d83031b77e6488.webm?t=1634652463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258580/extras/c5f3f9f34ee5fb34b5d83031b77e6488.mp4?t=1634652463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Invoke your weapons using a unique and ultra-satisfying motion-based spellcasting system that will soon make you feel invincible.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258580/extras/305bde9de2c4215d4957580aed38de74.poster.avif?t=1634652463\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258580/extras/305bde9de2c4215d4957580aed38de74.webm?t=1634652463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258580/extras/305bde9de2c4215d4957580aed38de74.mp4?t=1634652463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Fall, try again and unlock powerful new weapons and abilities to find your playstyle.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258580/extras/ccea3923f6a7ea51d210c79b3d09c607.poster.avif?t=1634652463\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258580/extras/ccea3923f6a7ea51d210c79b3d09c607.webm?t=1634652463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258580/extras/ccea3923f6a7ea51d210c79b3d09c607.mp4?t=1634652463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Battle armadas of deadly mechanical enemies until you reach epic boss fights that block your path to new solar systems. Along the way, you will meet a quirky roster of characters.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258580/extras/89da47b2182102d7baa45045c2d69643.poster.avif?t=1634652463\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258580/extras/89da47b2182102d7baa45045c2d69643.webm?t=1634652463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258580/extras/89da47b2182102d7baa45045c2d69643.mp4?t=1634652463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>And don't forget to admire the finer details of the extraordinary life forms you're bringing back to life as you chase the corrupt Architects of Entropy to the most remote corners of their cubic universe.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258580/extras/147c54ece9352e42f7307de37e9039ca.poster.avif?t=1634652463\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258580/extras/147c54ece9352e42f7307de37e9039ca.webm?t=1634652463\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1258580/extras/147c54ece9352e42f7307de37e9039ca.mp4?t=1634652463\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>For you are a Star Shaman, a champion of biodiversity, and the galaxy's last resort.<br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>9 powerful weapons to unlock<br></li><li>A unique spell casting system made for VR<br></li><li>3 solar systems to revive<br></li><li>The funkiest soundtrack in VR<br></li><li>50+ unlockable feats<br></li><li>11 unique achievements<br></li><li>Built-in Timer for speedruns</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"99cc96a2486010bed93b7191acd262ebf17f470d.jpg","localized_name":"Planet Sparker","name":"Planet Sparker","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1258580/99cc96a2486010bed93b7191acd262ebf17f470d.jpg"},{"icon":"4aa024a7e4d15bad6462a25044be75c91a6be7c4.jpg","localized_name":"Heptaka Cruncher","name":"Heptaka Cruncher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1258580/4aa024a7e4d15bad6462a25044be75c91a6be7c4.jpg"},{"icon":"0e71655970b0e67e283771c05f451b10e300fa96.jpg","localized_name":"Icosik Bin Bane","name":"Icosik Bin Bane","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1258580/0e71655970b0e67e283771c05f451b10e300fa96.jpg"},{"icon":"42912fb5db42dd4bc274d890f3f56d422fc244ce.jpg","localized_name":"Triaconte Munger","name":"Triaconte Munger","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1258580/42912fb5db42dd4bc274d890f3f56d422fc244ce.jpg"},{"icon":"139ee9b520fa19b52c52af4ad2c095e538f0a01e.jpg","localized_name":"Champion of Diversity","name":"Champion of Diversity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1258580/139ee9b520fa19b52c52af4ad2c095e538f0a01e.jpg"},{"icon":"c83661cafe1539953564f65cb1c8e7d88f39bf3b.jpg","localized_name":"Dodge Master","name":"Dodge Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1258580/c83661cafe1539953564f65cb1c